# No Magic Values

**Never use magic numbers or strings directly in code.** Extract them under `lib/src/core/constants/`.

## Hierarchy

```
lib/src/core/constants/
├── constants.dart
├── http/
├── auth/
├── api/
├── app/
├── features/
└── dev/
```

Import a specific file or the barrel `constants.dart`. See also `no-magic-values.mdc`.
